        "Take the role of a researcher selecting an eye-tracking system for a study of nonverbal communication. Compare the major recording techniques, weigh bright-pupil versus dark-pupil illumination, and choose among chin rest, head-mounted, and desk-mounted configurations. Match each configuration to the application it best serves.",
